unfulfilled in Okushima. Despite being nearly 100 years old, he is ruthless and greedy. He is an old monster who has devoured the lives of others for his own sake and harbors no remorse or fear. In order to fulfill the greatest \"wish\" of his life, he searches for the whereabouts of Tsuki, who has disappeared."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127083"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"奥志麻に君臨する実力者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高賀家の実質的な当主で、奥志麻で叶わない望みはない、と言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"百歳近い年齢でありながら冷酷で強欲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"己の為に他者の人生を喰らい潰し、一片の悔恨も畏れも抱かない老怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人生最大の「望み」を叶える為に、姿を消した津希の居所を捜す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13212","sourceWorkId":"24427","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"奥志麻に君臨する実力者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高賀家の実質的な当主で、奥志麻で叶わない望みはない、と言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"100歳近い年齢でありながら冷酷で強欲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"己のために他者の人生を喰らい潰し、一片の悔恨も畏れも抱かない老怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人生最大の“望み”を叶えるために、姿を消した津希の居所を捜す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……まことによい度胸をしておる」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47920"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47920","value":"他人の運命を変える瞬間"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47920","value":"日本酒"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ecd9f78f261e15ecca5e6171251e82d6cefab9be8e8f39d477ea57042009d42d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e37db5ef467712ea36cee229844196b53664f3c1e23ccaa43af810e5b78c9a0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"最上嗣生","creatorId":"vndb:s2241","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2241","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2241","name":"最上嗣生(中島嗣生)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196869:47